    "quota": {
        "window_seconds": 60,
        "budget_points": 300,
        "read_cost": 1,
        "write_cost": 1,
        "_note": "Standard-tier ads_analytics quota: 300 requests/min per user per app (dossier section 6). Trial tier is 1,000 requests/DAY per app -- a Trial app must be throttled via config before any backfill (open epic-26 probe question); the async report path is the quota-economical path either way (1 create + polls per 186-day window for the whole account). 429 body code 8 -> RateLimitError with retry_after from x-ratelimit-reset."
    },
